cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use BioSignal-FM in research, please cite the software release below."
title: "BioSignal-FM: Multimodal Biosignal Research Platform"
abstract: >-
  BioSignal-FM is a modular research platform for reproducible multimodal
  biosignal processing, representation-learning experiments, modality-specific
  adapters, evaluation, provenance, and artifact management. EMG, EEG, and ECG
  are core research tracks; ECoG/iEEG is experimental and fNIRS is an optional
  extension. The software does not claim a validated universal foundation model,
  clinical readiness, or cross-modal generalization without separately reported
  evidence.
